" termist   orbit-api ◆1✓1                                                       "
"┏━━━┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    "
"┃◆ c│ grid  g              new task: prompt, CLI, model                    │    "
"┃cla│ grid  Space          send the next instruction without entering      │    "
"┗━━━│ grid  Enter          type into the selected session                  │    "
"┌ cl│ grid  /              find a session                                  │───┐"
"│hel│ grid  .              next session that needs you                     │   │"
"│   │ grid  ,              previous session that needs you                 │   │"
"│   │ grid  n              new agent session                               │   │"
"│   │ grid  t              new shell                                       │   │"
"│   │ grid  h              card to the left                                │   │"
"│   │ grid  j              card below                                      │   │"
"│   │ grid  k              card above                                      │   │"
"│   │ g: new task: prompt, CLI, model                                      │   │"
"└───└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘───┘"
"j/k choose · Enter new key · Backspace no key · R default · Esc back            "
